# without jitter) plus pseudo-random scatters. Each is relaxed with a greedy
# "inflate circles to their max feasible radius, then nudge each center away
# from its tightest (wall or neighbor) constraint" iteration, which locally
# maximizes the sum of radii from that starting point.
